<title>ARGENTINA: U.S. IEI sells 36.7 mln shrs for $163.8 mln. [CORRECTED 21:45 GMT]</title>
<headline>U.S. IEI sells 36.7 mln shrs for $163.8 mln. [CORRECTED 21:45 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. firm International Equity Investment (IEI) Thursday said it sold 36.7 million ordinary class B shares of Argentina's CEI Citicorp Holdings SA for $163.8 million to Argentine firm Los W SA.</p>
<p>(Corrects seller from CEI to IEI).</p>
<p>The shares sold represent 11.4 percent of CEI's capital, the company told the Buenos Aires Stock Exchange.</p>
